## 9.2 Zeckendorf 平均横向能量

定义

$$
\boxed{
\mathscr E_{Q,\mathcal C}^{\perp}(\delta)
=
\frac1{M_Q}
\sum_{\eta\in\Omega_Q}
\sum_{i<j}W_{ij}
\sinh^2\!\left(
\delta E_Q(\eta)\Delta\omega_{ij}
\right).
}
\tag{A9.5}
$$

由能量双射，也可写为

$$
\mathscr E_{Q,\mathcal C}^{\perp}(\delta)
=
\frac1{M_Q}
\sum_{v=0}^{M_Q-1}
\sum_{i<j}W_{ij}
\sinh^2(\delta v\Delta\omega_{ij}).
\tag{A9.6}
$$

